# project init <folder> makes a new project with the standard layout (F-TLS-23)
** spec: design/design-project-layout.md
** The runner calls the command of the VM, not this script: see "command" below.
primary aspect e54_project_init is
  process main is
    print "e54: the command project init is tested, not this script";
  return;
end e54_project_init;
